---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import CTASection from '../components/CTASection.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About | Sunbeam Consulting" description="Diana Pfeil — MIT PhD, ex-Amazon, 2x startup CTO. AI strategy and fractional leadership for early-stage startups.">
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-8">About Sunbeam Consulting</h1>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-12 items-start">
        <!-- Photo placeholder -->
        <div class="md:col-span-1">
          <div class="aspect-square bg-slate-100 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-slate-400 text-sm">
            <img
              src="/images/diana-placeholder.jpg"
              alt="Diana Pfeil"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover rounded-xl"
              onerror="this.style.display='none';this.parentElement.innerHTML='<span class=\'text-slate-400 text-sm\'>Photo coming soon</span>'"
            />
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Story -->
        <div class="md:col-span-2 space-y-6 text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
          <p class="text-lg">
            I'm <strong class="text-slate-900">Diana Pfeil</strong> — MIT PhD, ex-Amazon engineer, and 2-time startup CTO.
          </p>

          <p>
            I didn't set out to start a consulting practice — I just kept getting the same call.
            Founders I knew were spinning their wheels trying to "do something with AI." They were
            getting pressure from investors, hearing buzzwords from competitors, and watching their
            teams build features that never launched.
          </p>

          <p>
            And I got it — because I'd been there. As a 2-time CTO for AI startups, I've lived every
            failure mode: vague roadmaps, endless experiments, strategy debt, and the growing tension
            between ambition and reality. But I also knew what it felt like when things clicked — when
            a team had the right direction, shipped with purpose, and built features customers actually
            believed in.
          </p>

          <p>
            That's what I wanted to help more teams do. So I built <strong class="text-slate-900">Sunbeam Consulting</strong>
            to bring clarity, momentum, and a bit of fun to AI product work.
          </p>

          <p>
            Because the truth is: AI isn't magic. But with the right focus and leadership, it can be transformative.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Credentials -->
      <div class="mt-16 pt-12 border-t border-slate-200">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-8">Background</h2>
        <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <div class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-sunbeam-400 mt-2 shrink-0"></div>
            <div>
              <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">MIT PhD</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Machine learning and computational research</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <div class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-sunbeam-400 mt-2 shrink-0"></div>
            <div>
              <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Ex-Amazon</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Recommendation systems engineer</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <div class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-sunbeam-400 mt-2 shrink-0"></div>
            <div>
              <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">2x Startup CTO</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">B2B AI product companies, teams up to 75 engineers</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <div class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-sunbeam-400 mt-2 shrink-0"></div>
            <div>
              <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">20+ Years in ML</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">From recommendation systems to GenAI and LLMs</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- What it's like -->
      <div class="mt-16 pt-12 border-t border-slate-200">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6">What It's Like to Work With Me</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-slate-700">
          <p>
            I'm friendly, humble, and non-jargony. I'm the opposite of a technical partner who
            doesn't have patience to explain things or communicate effectively.
          </p>
          <p>
            I'm encouraging and at the same time set high standards — and help everyone get there.
            Clients trust me to execute and come back with exactly what they expected, done at a high level.
          </p>
          <p>
            I bring clarity, momentum, and get-after-it energy — so your AI work delivers value your
            board, investors, and customers can see.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Links -->
      <div class="mt-12 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
        <a
          href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/dianapfeil/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="text-sunbeam-600 hover:text-sunbeam-700 font-semibold text-sm"
        >
          LinkedIn &rarr;
        </a>
        <a
          href="https://dianam.github.io"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="text-sunbeam-600 hover:text-sunbeam-700 font-semibold text-sm"
        >
          Personal Site &rarr;
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CTASection />
</BaseLayout>
